The '''Windmill Operator''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Windmill}}. They ask the player to bring them {{Item|String|amount=64}} and {{Item|Cobblestone|amount=64}}. After completing their quest, they unlock the [[Farm Merchant]]'s shop for the player.

